WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
A new reading object.
CODEX 1. The Zero-Watt Cognitive Engine.
一件新的阅读对象。零功耗认知引擎。

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.800
Material architecture.
Cellulose Display. Six layers. One structure.
材料结构。纤维视网膜系统。六层结构，一体装订。

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.200
Touch is the interface.
Every page is one gesture away.
触觉即界面。每一次翻动，都直达想去的地方。

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.600
The physical-to-digital bridge.
Scan the page edge. The context follows.
从纸页到云端。扫描页边标记，上下文随之而来。

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.000
Bookln. CODEX 1.
Concept preview.
Bookln。CODEX 1。概念预览。
